<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Pita</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Pita</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Na Saimon Pita, Jisas Krais niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, ye dedugwa yoba ta moglka i, pepa magigl i boglka. Na pepa boglka i, ene yoba ta no ka wakai kaim]a pre medunere mere kuno yegl pre mediglkwa i, bogl teiga. Jisas Krais, ye nono Godno moglsre, nono Ere Yugwa yagl moglkwa i, ye yagl du kaima moglsre, nono pre medraiglmedi erukwa pre nono ye pre medunga. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />God ya nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ene ere wakai ere tedre, deno muduno wida di padigl tebrika i, ene ye siragl mere ta miurere beke pai meglbi, mabuno i u podo enabedi prika.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">God yobama mogo wakai koramga paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Nono Jisas pre kan erumga igne, konbauna kane kane mina nono wakai mogl, God mabunomo sika sinamga i, ye ake ple di norukwa. Norume diga i, Jisas yene God moglsre, yobuglomo mina ake ple di norukwa pre diga. Te, Jisas ye wakai kaima moglko, abuglagemo wakai sumara nono agle di suna edugwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Edidre, ye ka wakai yene, bubuno erukwa promis di padigl norukwa. Ye promis di padigl norukwa i, ene pre gi dibi, God dem muduo pamere ama ene deno muduno yegl panabuka. Panan, yoba mudu tadaglme mina u kide pi meglkwa i, ama mokono tenamga pre promis i norukwa. Yoba tadaglme gun yei teigwa pre u kide pi kodigwa pre diga.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ana Jisas taragl kane kane noro kodugwa i pre ene Jisas pre mediglmara i mabuno du eramnedi kogon podo erio. Te, ene mabuno du eraiglmara i, ama nomane wakai io. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Te, ene nomane wakai inaiglmara i, ama mabuno kide ta deno muduno mina pogglau borabuka i, mane di teo. Te, ene mabuno kide mane di tenaiglmara i, yubun unabuka igne adigl gigledi molo. Te, ene adigl gigledi moraiglmara i, ene God mabunomo ta panabere i erio. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Te, ene God mabunomo pamere eraiglmara i, ene agroma abaroma wakai kanio. Te, ene agroma abaroma wakai kan moraiglmara i, yoba ama deno muduno teo.<verse eid="2PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ene mabuno wakai yegl, yegl erio diga i, siragl pre mabuno i, ene meglmara pai ede u podo enan, yoko moglkre, mogo wakai kogl moraiglkwa. Ene mogo wakai koraiglme diga i, Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais pre kan erimara i mina mogo koraiglkwa pre diga. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ba mabuno wakai i, agro swara ta moglmara paikran, ye gumuglo kin yogwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, God ye tadaglmemo koko ede te kodogwa i, kina yogwa paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, God ene ye yobama moraiglmedi kere i pere edidre, agle dugwa. Yegl pre ene yoba pere ido kanaiglmedi i nogugl edidre, na mabuno wakai pre dimere yegl erio. Ene yegl ere meglbi, ene ege swara ta yage sikraiglkwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Te, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais, nono ere yugwa yagl moglkwa i, yoba bitno moglsre, suglno aimadi kamun morabara ene i suna edenabuka igne i ye ene di wakai yei tedre, ene i suna edenabuka.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ana na ka erme boglka i, ene pre kan ere kodo, God kamo kaima ene meglmara yogwa i mina adigl gigledi meglkwa. Meglkwa ba ene ege ege poglo di praiglkwa pre di pai moraglka. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Na ene nomane tedre, ka i poglo di praiglmedi ere mogl pi goraglka i, i aglau eriedi ta prikrika. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />I siragl pre na prika i, na ogona nagna kide kodinaglka ege i, ede magigl u kodugwa. Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais okna di narumere yegl, na goraglka magigl erumedi prika. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Yegl pre na ka i ene kaima di tenagledi prisre, bogl atne ediga. Siragl pre na goraglka ba ene okuo ka i ama ege ege pre meglbi, kuno erabedi prisre, boglka.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas abuglagemo ye dedugwa yoba kandre, kamo di wai digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ana no Jisas aposelma munga i, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas Krais yobuglomo podo pamiwe didre, ama ede ikne unabiwe di, ene yegl di tomga i, yoba tau kubu kaman mere yegl ta di noriko, dikrumga. No nono gugmuglno mina ye siragl mere wakai yene moglsre, abuglage podo sugwa i, kamga pre dumga. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />I siragl pre Neno Kade God, ege swara igne Jisas abuglagemo nogugl panabedi ersre, Jisas kagie kade togwa. Neno Kade wakai yene moglsre, abuglagemo podo sugwa i kagie kade tedre, ka yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2PE 1:17">I na Wana moglmiwa. Ye na dena muduna suna moglko, na ye wakai kaima kaniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Matyu 17.5, Mak 9.7, Luk 9.35</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2PE 1:17">dugwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />God heven ibo mogl, ka yegl dugwa i, no Jisas bogl akie muglo ibo munga igne, prumga. Kamun muglo i, God yene u ka dugwa pre yene dumomo yogwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, no kandre, Ka kep yoba God kamo okna ta beglkwa i, erme mogo koglmedi kandre, ye kamo pre medunga. Ye ka beglkwa i, ken ta min erumara de, abuglage wakai ta sugwa mere yegl paugwa pre ye kano wakai ere kinano gudu pramga paugwa. Kugl kuri ta tagna mogl ege ege abuglage sugwa i, ene deno muduno mina abuglage podo si tenan, kamin kor ta tagenabuka.<verse eid="2PE 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Ana ene taragl swara ta praiglkwa podo paugwa i, yegl paugwa, God kamo kep yoba meglkwa i, ye God kamo siragl mere beglkwa i, ye yene primere ta boglkrikwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Te, ye yene ka boramnedi prisre, ege swara ta ka kep ere boglkrikwa ba Mudu Murubuglo ye nomane togo, God ye boraiglmedi prumere keme beglkwa.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Ka mabuno kibi didre, bakagl te dinaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ba okna ibo Israel yoba meglmara suna i, ka kep yoba kibi tau ama u digwa. Te, ene meglmara ama yoba u ene ka mabuno kibi beke tenaiglkwa paugwa. Ye teke konbo ede suna udre, ka mabuno kibi tau ene ere kide ere tenabuka paugwa i, ene di tenaiglkwa. Te, Yagl Kade ye tadaglmeno topo togwa i, ama mokono tenaiglkwa. Ye yene mabuno yegl eraiglmara i, God ye tabre ere kide ere tenabuka.<verse eid="2PE 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Te, ka mabuno kibi dinaiglkwa yobamo i, mabuno deglbi yogwa ama eraiglkwa. Eribi, yoba tau mere ye mabuno eraiglmara i, duglo boraiglkwa. Yegl eribi, yoba bina meglkwa i kandre, God konbaunamo kaima yogwa i, kenaglmo sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Te, yoba ka mabuno kibi dinaiglkwa i, ye ama ene taraglno bubuno goraiglkwa pre ene ka kibi di tedre, ene taraglno inamnedi ene bakagl tenaiglkwa. Yoba i kamun kuade God kot ere tedre, ere kide ere tenagledi di paduglkwa. Te, God erme ugl paikre, ye kan moglkwa pre ye dumere kaima yoba i ere tenabuka.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Te, enene ama prikwa, angelo tau okna tadaglme erikwa i, God ye kanige erekrukwa ba ye okuo kot mina adraiglmedi si kane si i pi dumo kidile, mim podo erumara edugwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Te, Noa moglkwa igne, yoba uglo koglo koglo mogl, God mokono teigwa i, God ye kanige erekre, nigl kamin podo dedugo, sugwa. Ba mabuno du pre ka beke te moglkwa yagl Noa i yogo, ye yobama 7-pela yeigo, God ye suglno moglsre, ere yugwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Te, dumo Sodom ya Gomora i, God ye ka tage tenagle dugwa. Didre, kaima gagl tege erukwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, God mokono tenaiglkwa yoba ta okuo moraiglkwa i kandre, nomane inaiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ba God dumo suo i ere kide ersre, Lot ere yugwa. Ana Lot Sodom moglkwa igne, ye yagl du moglkwa pre yoba kide i, mabuno kide ere ede podo eigo, Lot dem muduo yubun dogwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Lot ye yagl du moglko, dem muduo pe sugwa ba Sodom yoba, God lomo kide kodigwa i, meglmara suna kipaugwa pre ye ege ege mabuno kide erikwa i kandre, ka kide digwa i prisre, erukwa. Yegl pre ye dem muduo mina giugl pre moglkwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ana God yoba tau ka tage tedre, tau ere idre, erumara i mina nono pre pogl sinamga i, God ye yoba siragl mere ere inabuka ya ka tage tenabuka i, yene pre kan ere kodumedi pre pogl sinamga. Yoba ta God mabunomo duglo beglkwa i, ye yubun i dinaiglmedi ere yugwa ba yoba du ta moglkrikwa i, ye okuo kot mina adraiglmedi ka tage te moglkwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Te, God ka podo kaima tage tenabuka i, yoba deno muduno goglo paugwa i duglo boglsre, bitno yoba kano sedidre, ama mabuno kide deglbi yogwa ere wan meglkwa i, ka tage tenabuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Yoba kide i, ye bitno yoba kano kuduglno gogl tekre, yene nomano duglo bogl meglkwa. Te, ye angelo kide gigledi meglkwa i, kuduglno goglkre, di kide yei teigwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ana angelo meglkwa i, ene prio. Ye yobuglno podo paugo, ye mogl mitna ede edigwa ba angelo ere mogl, Yagl Kade gumuglo mina angelo kide ka tage tenamnedi erekrikwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ana yoba ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye nomano wakai paikruko, taragl ta deno muduno mina pogglau boglkwa i keme, duglo bogl meglkwa pre ye agl bugla are mere yegl meglkwa. Te, ye taragl tau pre kan pogl sikrikwa i, kenaglno keme sigwa. Agl bugla are yoba kitn kogl, ere sinaiglkwa pre meglmere yegl, yoba i ama yegl meglkwa pre okuo ye u kide enaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Yoba i, ye mabunono kide yegl paugwa pre God topo kide te ikne edenan, inaiglkwa. Ye mabuno gua gua ermine nogugl erikwa i, agai goglkre, gun yeigwa. Te, ye ene bogl akie kaya mokna podo neigwa igne, ye ene bakagl tedre, wakai erumnedi prikwa. Ye mabuno erimara i, ene si deglbi yedre, ere kide ere teigwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Yoba i, ye ege ege abu kandre, bubuno gogl, ye bogl mabuno kide eramnedi prikwa. Te, ye tadaglme kide kodokre, ege ege ere pai moramnedi prikwa. Yoba tau kiano mina yobro paikrukwa i, ye yage sinaiglmedi kinano sigwa. Te, ye yoba pere taraglno bubuno goraiglkwa mabuno i mina sule didre, pre kan ere kodigwa mere yegl paugwa. Yegl pre yoba i, God ye ere kide ere tenabuka meglkwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ana yoba ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye konbo du yogwa i kide kodidre, ede eglke eigwa. Ye erikwa i, yagl Beor wam, Balam we digwa okna ibo ta erumere yegl erikwa. Yagl Balam i, mige moni wakai kanugwa pre ye mige moni inagledi mabuno kide erukwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ba Balam mabuno kide yegl erukwa pre donki ta ye ka togwa. Donki meglkwa i, ka ta dikrikwa ba ege i, donki ta ere mogl, yoba ka dumnere yegl didre, ka kep yagl Balam, ye du mere yegl erukwa i, si kegl di tenagledi erukwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Balaam on donkey" file="CO00867B.TIF" size="col" loc="2.16" copy="David C Cook" ref="2.16">Balam donkimo ka dugwa</figure><verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Ana yoba ka mabuno kibi digwa i, maugl nigl ta kugla di kodugwa mere yegl meglkwa. Te, ade dogwa igne, kamun nubun moglko, sinabedi gun yomga ba ir mage i ede bage ta ogo, sikrumere yegl ama meglkwa. Ye mim podo erumara ime moraiglmedi God di padigl kodugwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Yoba i, ye mogl mitna edidre, ka kane kane, mem wakai ta paikrukwa i digwa. Te, yoba tau mabuno kide mina suna mogl dinamnedi erme ga teke ede meda wigwa i, ye kinano sidre, mabuno gua gua ya te mabuno tau ogono nagino mina pogglau borabuka i eraiglmedi erikwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ye ama kinano sidre, Ene no duglo beglbi, ene kane ta paikraiglmiwe digwa ba ye yene ama mabuno kide, kubuno erukwa i mina atne kane paigwa. I siragl pre yoba ta taragl swara ta na bitna morabedi kanige eran, ye taragl i boimo padre, niglmo kogonmo yoba morabuka mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Yagl Kade Jisas Krais, nono Ere Yugwa Yagl siragl mere ta ere norumere i, yoba ta pre kan ersre, mabuno deglbi yogwa erikwa i kide kodinaiglkwa. Kide kodinaiglkwa ba okuo mabuno kide ta kigln mere yegl panan, ye pi si paibi, ye igne i u kide kaima enaiglkwa. Ye okna meglkwa i tau wakai dagl paugwa ba, ye kigln mina yage sinaiglkwa igne, ye u kide kaima enaiglkwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Ye mabuno du duglo boraiglkwa konbo i ta pre kan erekrima, tau wakai dagl paugo, ba ye pre kan ere kodigwa pre kide kodibi, i kide kaima panabuka. I siragl pre God yene ye mabuno siragl mere eraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa i, ye prikwa ba kide kodigwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ka ebrie ta mabunomo kaima paugwa i, yoba i meglmara plau dugwa. Ka ebrie i, yegl dugwa, Agl ta mebigl si meda edidre, aglke kor pi nogwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ame Wakai Dinaiglkwa 26.11</char></note> Te, ka ebrie ta ama yegl paugwa, Ene bugla ta nigl pai tenatnga ba bugla i aglke ede ikne pidre, gaba buglkwa mina ugl uglo panabuka. Yoba i, mabunono yegl mere paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade aglke ikne unabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, na erme ege suo ene pepa bogl teiga. Na pepa suo bogl teimara i mina ene ka tau okna prikwa i kor poglo di prisre, ka pamere mere nomane inaiglmedi pre boglka. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Na ene ka tau kor poglo di praiglmedi prika i, God kamo kep yoba ka okna ibo digwa i ene poglo di praiglmedi prika. Te, nono Yaglno Kade nono Ere Yugwa yagl moglkwa i, ye nono mabuno siragl mere ta erio dugo, no aposelma ene di tomga i, ene ama poglo di praiglmedi prisre, pepa boglka.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ana ene ka swara ta praiglkwa podo paugwa i, yegl paugwa, ege okuo kaima ta unan, God kamo gaugl ere teigwa yoba tau unaiglkwa. Ye mabuno kide ta deno muduno mina pogglau borabuka i ere wan moglsre, <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />ka boglo ere yegl dinaiglkwa, Yagl Kade ede ikne unagledi ka kaima di paduglme digwa ba ye aglo moglme? Makan gaba koragle paugwa igne, taragl kane kane siragl mere paimere i, erme ama kuno yegl pai meglkwa. Nono kowano awano mogl, geglkwa igne, ede u erme pra, taragl mudu okna ibo paimere mere kuno paigwa. U pere ta pikrimiwe di, yegl dinaiglkwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ana yoba tau yegl dinaiglkwa ba God siragl mere okna erukwa i, yene pre dinamnedi erikwa pre ye ta pre pogl sikrikwa. God okna ibo ye ka dumara mina kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan ere yogwa. Dumo makan ere yogwa i, nigl ake wai dugo, God ere mogl, nigl moglmara i, makan gaba plau dinabedi eruko, plau di ede nogugl ugwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Te, okuo, nigl swara i mina dumo makan okna yogwa i, ede u kide ogwa. I siragl pre nigl podo sidre, dumo makan ere kide ere kodugwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Te, God ye ka dumara mina dumo makan ya kamun mitna erme paigwa i sugl moglsre, okuo doga mina ere kide eragledi di paduglkwa. God ye okuo yoba kotno prisre, yoba ta ye mokono teigwa i ere kide ere tenabuka igne i ye dumo makan ya kamun mitna doga mina ere kide erabuka.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, dena muduna suna meglkwa i, God okuo yoba kotno prisre, dumo makan ere kide erabuka ba ene ka swara ta pre moraiglkwa paugwa. Ka i yegl mere paugwa, Yagl Kade gumuglo mina ege swara ta yogwa i, bugla yugu 1,000 bogl kuno yogwa. Te, bugla yugu 1,000 i, ama ege swara bogl kuno yogwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Yagl Kade ye ede ikne unagledi ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, ye tau kanana moglsre, ede ikne ukrumedi yegl ta prikramga. Yoba tau yegl mere praiglkwa ba nono pre pogl sinamga i, Yagl Kade tabre ede ikne ukrukwa i, siragl pre ye yoba goraiglmedi prikrukwa. Ye yoba mudu nomano yake tenaiglmedi prisre, sugl moglkwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">God ye kamun mitna ya dumo makan kor ere yenabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Fervent heat" file="co00656b.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="3.10" />Ana Yagl Kade unabuka igne i tabre plau dinabuka. Yoba ugl paigwa igne, kunogl gogl yoba ede yugugl wimere yegl, yoba kankre meglbi, tabre plau dinabuka. Ege i plau dinan, ade ba ya kugl kuri bla didre, doga de, dudinaiglkwa. Te, dumo makan ya yoba taragl kane kane dumo makan mina erikwa i, doga de kodinabuka.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Ana taragl kane kane yegl mere u kide pi kodidre, dudunabuka pre ene siragl mere mogl pai eribi, kuno erabedi prime? Ene God we di pre wan moglsre, ye mabunomo duglo bogl moraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Te, God ege ta Yagl Kade unabedi di paduglkwa i, ene ege i tabre unabu ba di prisre, kie ere molo. Ege i unan, kamun mitna ibo ya taragl kane kane mitna ibo paigwa i, doga dedre, de kurdi ede u kide pi kodinaiglkwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ba God ka kaima di noro paduglkwa i, ye kamun mitna ya dumo makan kor ere yenagle dugwa. Te, dumo makan kor i mina mabuno du keme panabuka. Yegl pre nono kamun mitna ya dumo makan kor i, unabedi kie ere munga.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, ene taragl yegl mere plau dinabedi sugl meglkwa pre God no mabunono wakai kanabedi ene erme kogon podo erio. Ene ye bogl deno muduno swara yebi, ene ye gumuglo mina ene aglauno ta paikran, wakai erikwa pamedi kanabuka pre diga.<verse eid="2PE 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Te, Yagl Kade tabre ukrukwa i, ene ama praiglkwa, ye sugl kan mogl, yoba ere inagledi prukwa pamedi praiglkwa. Na ka yegl diga i, agro Pol, ye nono deno muduno suna moglkwa i, ama ka kuno yegl mere ene bogl togwa. God ye Pol nomane wakai togo, <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />ye pepa mudu boglmara i mina mabuno tau yegl mere pre dugwa. Ye pepa boglmara suna i, mem tau atne paugwa pre yoba pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, ege tau waragne dagl paugwa. Pol ka boglkwa i, yoba tau God kamo beke ikre, nomano gigle dikrukwa i, ye ake yake tedre, di ta edigwa. Te, ye God kamo mudu idre, ama yegl keme erikwa pre ye yene u kide enaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ana agrama abarama wagle, na dena muduna suna meglkwa i, taragl kane kane yegl plau dinabuka i, ene pre kodigwa pre ene kan kun erio. Yoba kide meglkwa i, ene ta bakagl tebi, ene adigl gigledi moglkre, yage si dinaiglmedi prika. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Jisas Krais ye nono Yaglno Kade moglsre, nono Ere Yugwa yagl moglkwa i, yoko kaima ere wakai ere norukwa. Norumara i mina nomane wakai wakai idre, yakinaiglkwa paugwa. Te, ene Jisas siragl mere moglkwa i, pre pogl si pai meglbi, ene yakenaiglkwa. Jisas Krais moglkwa i, nono ye kagie kade erme tedre, aimadi kamin te pai moramga paugwa. Kaima.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>